   "comment": "Per (current episode, PersistentSurface matched this epoch through an applied segment S): a SurfaceLook holding the mean RetinalPercept red_green / blue_yellow / intensity over S's member cells, once every member percept carries the epoch. episode -includes_look-> look -look_of-> P.",
